  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/image_6.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 359px\" /></p>\n<p>Una divertida fiesta de la espuma ha puesto fin este mi&eacute;rcoles a los actos conmemorativos del X aniversario de la pe&ntilde;a L&#39;Aj&aacute;,&nbsp;de Toga, que han incluido tambi&eacute;n una discom&oacute;vil despu&eacute;s de <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=39642\" target=\"_blank\">las paellas</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image.jpg\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_1.jpg\" alt=\"image_1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_10.jpg\" alt=\"image_10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_11.jpg\" alt=\"image_11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_12.jpg\" alt=\"image_12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_2.jpg\" alt=\"image_2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_3.jpg\" alt=\"image_3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_4.jpg\" alt=\"image_4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestaespumapenaajatoga/image_5.jpg\" alt=\"image_5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><